ddress><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HORI MASASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHBAYASHI KUNIHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI TAKAHISA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FPS INC.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HORI, MASASHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHBAYASHI, KUNIHIKO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, TAKAHISA</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HORI MASASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHBAYASHI KUNIHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI TAKAHISA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HORI, MASASHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHBAYASHI, KUNIHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, TAKAHISA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A yoke (20) includes flat, rectangular permanent magnets (m18, m28, m38) arranged with the opposite polarity pole faces alternated. A diaphragm (26) includes pairs of spiral coils (L18, L28, L38) arranged on both sides thereof in positions corresponding to those of the permanent magnets. The outline of each of coils is similar to that of the corresponding permanent magnet. The magnetic flux in parallel with the surface of the diaphragm is interlinked with each of the coils, and the force exerted on the current of each coil from the magnetic field is perpendicular to the vibratory face. Therfore the force along the vibratory face is significantly weakened, the noise is reduced, and the quality of sound is improved.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un transducteur acoustique plan qui comprend un moyeu (20) comportant des aimants permanents rectangulaires (m18, m28, m38), les faces des pôles à polarités opposées étant disposées par alternance. Un diaphragme (26) comporte sur ses deux faces des paires de bobines (L18, L28, L38) disposées dans des positions correspondant à celles des aimants permanents. La forme de chacune des bobines est similaire à celle de l'aimant permanent correspondant. Le flux magnétique parallèle à la surface du diaphragme est relié à chacune des bobines, la force exercée sur le courant de chaque bobine en provenance du champ magnétique étant perpendiculaire à la face vibratoire. Ainsi, la force exercée le long de la face vibratoire est fortement affaiblie, le bruit est réduit et la qualité du son est améliorée.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>